entious (reliability) and handles stress very well, which are critical. While B sometimes adopts the wrong tone, this is less severe than C's difficulty communicating ideas and egocentric attitude. Therefore I would recommend Candidate B.\"\n\nVote: Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
